WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.820
Hunting zombies is hard.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.580
It took me over two hours to climb that tree.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.020
This is what their meat looks like. I eat it to survive.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:23.880
I need to CRAFT something to harvest more than one zombie at a time!

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:34.780
First tool I need to craft is a stone axe. The recipe is easy: stone + sticks.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.880
Not showing off or anything, but I'm really strong.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:53.400
Short fences are great for keeping the zombies out of my camp. And for controlling their movement, which we'll need later.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:58.200
Thankfully they're stupid and don't realize they could just climb right over them.

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:08.660
One time I got lost in a mine for 10 weeks. Never again.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:10.900
However, I found these neat crystals there.

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:16.940
I'm going to use them to craft a BIG and STRONG axe that can cut through more than one zombie at once.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:30.080
Sometimes I forget the crafting recipes. I used to be able to just look them up online.

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:33.440
I really don't wanna go back to the mines for more crystals.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:40.220
Notice how I use their ultra-rare gold-tier gypsum crystals. Makes a big difference.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.360
Sweet!

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.600
Since I'm alone all the time I think a lot about my old life, before the apocalypse.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:59.840
I had a house, a family, just my meemaw and my brother...

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:03.640
...but it was all destroyed in the great war.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:06.820
Somtimes I try to forget it, but I cant...

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:14.980
Anyways, don't forget to tie the blade down really tight or your might have an accident.

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:23.580
I call this guy Tony because his face looks like a piece of a pizza.

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:25.760
Let's slice him up!

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:40.160
Surprise, here comes bitch boy to steal my morsels.

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:42.660
He's my neighbor, too.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:47.480
I need to find a way to keep the meat from flying into the woods. Very frustrating.

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:52.360
I'm crafting a chute and backboard to guide the meat back into the camp.

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:03.360
Fun fact: this is my only pair of underwear.

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:19.260
What you're witnessing is AN ACT OF WAR!

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:29.100
Mission: Infiltrate Bitch Boy's Camp and Straight-Up Murder Him

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.660
I regret my decision to kill him.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:07.920
Spoiler alert: I got my camera back.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:12.400
I also apologized for calling him "bitch boy".

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:17.600
He used ME as the final piece in making my harvester operational.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.940
The trip wire was a good idea, too.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:49.260
The meat we got was a little tough however. Look how rigid the meat is.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:56.240
My neighbor claims to be a decent chef as well.

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:17.400
Time for a taste of our labors...

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:25.940
Taste test! Verdict?

